<title>SINGAPORE: Hwa Tat Lee sells building for S$20.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Hwa Tat Lee sells building for S$20.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furniture maker Hwa Tat Lee said on Tuesday its subsidiary, Hwa Tat Lee Manufacturing Pte Ltd, had entered a sale and purchase agreement to sell a factory building to Natsteel Electronics Pte Ltd for Singapore $20.1 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement accompanying its half year results that the sale was subject to approval by the Jurong Town Corporation and company shareholders.</p>
<p>It added that if the sale is completed, the company would realise an extraordinary gain of about S$2.7 million for the current financial year ending on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
